# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
#  Line endings are declared HERE so a clone behaves identically on every
#  machine, instead of depending on whatever core.autocrlf each person has set.
#  Without this file, two contributors can produce diffs that differ in every
#  line while the code is unchanged.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

#  Normalise everything git detects as text to LF, in the repository AND in the
#  working tree. PowerShell -- Windows PowerShell 5.1 included -- reads LF
#  scripts without complaint, so there is no reason to carry two conventions.
*               text=auto eol=lf

#  Never transform these, whatever git's content detection thinks.
*.png           binary
*.jpg           binary
*.ico           binary
*.zip           binary
